body:
I tried to write a proper test for react-native, simple rendering. But it works while it should not (createElement('View') is not failing). It seems to be a jest issue, in jest, this works perfectly (with the native preset):

```js
import 'react-native';
import React from 'react';

import renderer from 'react-test-renderer';

it('renders correctly', () => {
  const Root = 'View';
  const App = () => <Root/>;

  const tree = renderer.create(
    <App />
  ).toJSON();
  expect(tree).toMatchSnapshot();
});
```

see https://github.com/facebook/jest/issues/2283
